---
title: Sunday Brunch
servings: 2
course: brunch
---

== Dough ==

Mix @flour{1/2%cup} with @salt{a pinch} and @water{2-3%tbsp} in a #mixing bowl{}.

Knead for ~{10%minutes}, then let it rest for ~rest{1%hour}.

> Cold water makes the crust flakier.

== Topping ==

Spread @hollandaise{150%g} over the dough and add @onion{1} from a #pan{2}.

Bake for ~{20-25%minutes}.
